{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23880","headline":"劝酒十四首 不如来饮酒七首 四 · 白居易","name":"劝酒十四首 不如来饮酒七首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莫事长征去，辛勤难具论。\n何曾画麟阁，祗是老辕门。\n虮蝨衣中物，刀枪面上痕。\n不如来饮酒，合眼醉昏昏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23880.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23880","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}